1
00:00:00,174 --> 00:00:07,107
Namaskar dosto! Aaj ki video mein hum Excel ka ek bahut hi useful practical
kaam seekhne wale hain.

2
00:00:07,672 --> 00:00:13,604
Maan lijiye aapke paas All Data naam ki ek
sheet hai, jismein employees ke naam, stock

3
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:18,915
items, In Quantity, Out Quantity aur Amount ka bahut saara data diya hua hai.

4
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:27,544
Ab aapko ek alag Summary sheet banani hai, jahan har employee aur har stock
item ka total automatically calculate ho.

5
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:37,710
Aapko baar-baar manually filter lagakar total nikalne ki zarurat nahi padegi.
Hum formulas ka use karke poori summary report banayenge.

6
00:00:38,275 --> 00:00:42,136
Chaliye, isko actual Excel mein step by step karte hain.

7
00:00:43,223 --> 00:00:46,103
Sabse pehle hamare paas All Data sheet hai.

8
00:00:46,668 --> 00:00:52,086
Column A mein Date hai, column B mein Employee
Name, column C mein Stock Item, column D

9
00:00:52,086 --> 00:00:56,695
mein In Quantity, column E mein Out Quantity aur column F mein Amount hai.

10
00:00:57,260 --> 00:01:06,988
Ab dhyan se dekhiye, Rahul Sharma ka naam ek se zyada baar aa raha hai. Isi
tarah ek hi employee alag-alag stock items ke saath bhi aa sakta hai.

11
00:01:07,553 --> 00:01:17,047
Humein har row ko alag-alag calculate nahi karna. Humein same employee aur
same stock item ko ek saath group karke uska total nikalna hai.

12
00:01:17,612 --> 00:01:21,943
Iske liye hum Summary naam ki doosri worksheet ka use karenge.

13
00:01:23,030 --> 00:01:27,168
Ab neeche plus button par click karke ek nayi worksheet banaiye.

14
00:01:27,733 --> 00:01:29,675
Is sheet ka naam Summary rakhiye.

15
00:01:31,299 --> 00:01:35,053
Ab hum ismein apni final report ka structure banayenge.

16
00:01:35,619 --> 00:01:40,649
Column A mein Employee Name, column B
mein Stock Item, column C mein Total In

17
00:01:40,649 --> 00:01:46,072
Quantity, column D mein Total Out Quantity
aur column E mein Total Amount rakhenge.

18
00:01:46,637 --> 00:01:52,610
Yahan hum sirf un employee aur stock combinations ko rakhenge jinka total
humein chahiye.

19
00:01:53,176 --> 00:01:59,021
Dhyan rahe, All Data original data ke liye hai, aur Summary hamari final report
ke liye hai.

20
00:02:00,108 --> 00:02:05,313
Ab Summary sheet mein hum employee aur stock item ke combinations enter
karenge.

21
00:02:05,878 --> 00:02:08,524
Pehli row mein Rahul Sharma aur Laptop.

22
00:02:09,089 --> 00:02:11,798
Doosri row mein Rahul Sharma aur Tablet.

23
00:02:12,364 --> 00:02:14,753
Teesri row mein Priya Das aur Mobile.

24
00:02:15,318 --> 00:02:17,729
Chauthi row mein Aman Khan aur Tablet.

25
00:02:18,294 --> 00:02:20,875
Aur paanchvi row mein Aman Khan aur Laptop.

26
00:02:21,441 --> 00:02:24,875
Ye hamari summary report ke lookup combinations hain.

27
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:33,163
Ab agle steps mein Excel in combinations ke hisaab se All Data se totals
automatically calculate karega.

28
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:38,005
Ab samajhte hain ki hum SUMIFS formula kyun use kar rahe hain.

29
00:02:38,570 --> 00:02:43,413
Hamare example mein Rahul Sharma ke naam par Laptop ki teen entries hain.

30
00:02:43,978 --> 00:02:51,743
In teeno entries ki In Quantity ko add karna hai, lekin Rahul Sharma ke Tablet
records ko include nahi karna.

31
00:02:52,308 --> 00:02:57,791
Isi tarah humein sirf usi employee aur usi stock item ki entries select karni hain.

32
00:02:58,356 --> 00:03:05,419
SUMIFS formula mein hum pehle batate hain ki kaunsi values
add karni hain. Phir hum pehli condition dete hain,

33
00:03:05,419 --> 00:03:11,583
jaise Employee Name Rahul Sharma. Uske baad doosri
condition dete hain, jaise Stock Item Laptop.

34
00:03:12,148 --> 00:03:17,098
Excel dono conditions match karne wali rows ka total nikal deta hai.

35
00:03:17,663 --> 00:03:22,697
Yaani hum ek saath do conditions ke basis par total calculate karenge.

36
00:03:23,784 --> 00:03:26,067
Ab formula practically lagate hain.

37
00:03:26,632 --> 00:03:31,966
Summary sheet mein C3 cell select kijiye, kyunki yahan Total In Quantity
chahiye.

38
00:03:32,531 --> 00:03:34,579
Ab ye formula enter kijiye:

39
00:03:35,144 --> 00:03:47,859
=SUMIFS('All Data'!$D:$D,'All Data'!$B:$B,$A3,'All Data'!$C:$C,$B3)

40
00:03:48,424 --> 00:03:50,088
Chaliye, isko samajhte hain.

41
00:03:50,653 --> 00:03:58,824
Sabse pehle humne All Data sheet ka column D select kiya hai, kyunki isi column
mein In Quantity hai. Ye values add hongi.

42
00:03:59,389 --> 00:04:08,050
Uske baad All Data ka column B hai, jismein Employee Name hai. Excel isko
Summary sheet ke A3 wale employee name se match karega.

43
00:04:08,616 --> 00:04:16,893
Phir All Data ka column C hai, jismein Stock Item hai. Excel isko Summary sheet
ke B3 wale stock item se match karega.

44
00:04:17,458 --> 00:04:20,765
A3 mein Rahul Sharma hai aur B3 mein Laptop hai.

45
00:04:21,330 --> 00:04:26,962
Ab Excel sirf Rahul Sharma aur Laptop wali entries ki In Quantity add karega.

46
00:04:27,527 --> 00:04:29,362
Result aaya 190.

47
00:04:29,927 --> 00:04:35,474
Dekhiye, original data mein 100 plus 50 plus 40, total 190 hota hai.

48
00:04:36,039 --> 00:04:38,428
Yaani formula sahi kaam kar raha hai.

49
00:04:39,515 --> 00:04:42,353
Ab humein Total Out Quantity nikalni hai.

50
00:04:42,918 --> 00:04:47,163
Pichhle formula mein hum column D ki In Quantity add kar rahe the.

51
00:04:47,728 --> 00:04:51,739
Ab Out Quantity ke liye All Data ka column E use karenge.

52
00:04:52,304 --> 00:04:53,286
Formula hai:

53
00:04:53,851 --> 00:05:00,016
=SUMIFS('All Data'!$E:$E,'All Data'!$B:$B,$A3,'All Data'!$C:$C,$B3)

54
00:05:00,581 --> 00:05:06,192
Conditions wahi rahengi. Employee Name bhi same rahega aur Stock Item bhi
same rahega.

55
00:05:06,757 --> 00:05:08,784
Sirf Sum Range badal gaya hai.

56
00:05:09,349 --> 00:05:12,762
Enter press karne ke baad result 45 aata hai.

57
00:05:13,328 --> 00:05:17,936
Yaani Rahul Sharma ke Laptop ki total Out Quantity 45 hai.

58
00:05:19,023 --> 00:05:21,049
Ab teesra total hai Amount.

59
00:05:21,614 --> 00:05:27,545
Amount All Data sheet ke column F mein hai. Isliye hum Sum Range mein column
F use karenge.

60
00:05:28,110 --> 00:05:29,092
Formula hai:

61
00:05:29,657 --> 00:05:33,988
=SUMIFS('All Data'!$F:$F,'All Data'!$B:$B,$A3,'All Data'!$C:$C,$B3)

62
00:05:35,266 --> 00:05:38,700
Dono conditions wahi hain. Employee Name aur Stock Item.

63
00:05:39,266 --> 00:05:40,588
Enter press kijiye.

64
00:05:41,153 --> 00:05:43,116
Result aaya 9500.

65
00:05:43,681 --> 00:05:49,889
Original data mein 5000 plus 2500 plus 2000, total 9500 hota hai.

66
00:05:50,454 --> 00:06:01,014
Ab hamari pehli summary row complete ho gayi hai. Employee Name, Stock
Item, Total In Qty, Total Out Qty aur Total Amount sab formula se aa rahe hain.

67
00:06:02,101 --> 00:06:06,347
Ab har row mein alag-alag formula type karne ki zarurat nahi hai.

68
00:06:06,912 --> 00:06:10,261
C3 se E3 tak ke formulas select kijiye.

69
00:06:10,827 --> 00:06:16,629
Selection ke bottom-right corner par chhota sa square hota hai, jise Fill Handle
kehte hain.

70
00:06:17,194 --> 00:06:20,032
Isko drag karke row 7 tak le jaiye.

71
00:06:20,597 --> 00:06:27,637
Excel har row ke employee name aur stock item ko read karke corresponding
totals calculate kar dega.

72
00:06:28,202 --> 00:06:34,587
Ab dekhiye, Rahul Sharma ke Tablet ka total alag
aa gaya. Priya Das ke Mobile ka total alag aa

73
00:06:34,587 --> 00:06:40,021
gaya. Aman Khan ki Tablet aur Laptop ki entries bhi alag calculate ho gayi hain.

74
00:06:40,586 --> 00:06:45,429
Is tarah humne five rows ki summary report formulas se complete kar li.

75
00:06:46,516 --> 00:06:49,929
Ab report ke last mein Grand Total add karte hain.

76
00:06:50,494 --> 00:06:52,564
A8 mein Grand Total likhiye.

77
00:06:53,129 --> 00:06:55,198
C8 mein ye formula lagaiye:

78
00:06:55,763 --> 00:06:58,067
=SUM(C3:C7)

79
00:06:58,633 --> 00:06:59,593
D8 mein:

80
00:07:00,158 --> 00:07:02,462
=SUM(D3:D7)

81
00:07:03,027 --> 00:07:04,179
Aur E8 mein:

82
00:07:04,744 --> 00:07:06,963
=SUM(E3:E7)

83
00:07:07,528 --> 00:07:16,893
Ab hamare total In Quantity 515, total Out Quantity 111, aur total Amount
37800 aa gaya hai.

84
00:07:17,459 --> 00:07:22,643
Dhyan rahe, ye Grand Total hamari summary ki values ko add karke aa raha hai.

85
00:07:23,208 --> 00:07:33,896
Agar aapka source data bahut bada hai, toh aap apni reporting requirements ke
hisaab se totals ko source data se independently verify bhi kar sakte hain.

86
00:07:34,983 --> 00:07:41,724
Ab maan lijiye ki humein sirf employee-wise total chahiye aur stock item ko
alag-alag show nahi karna.

87
00:07:44,374 --> 00:07:47,211
Iske liye hum SUMIF formula use karenge.

88
00:07:47,777 --> 00:07:51,574
SUMIF ek condition ke basis par values add karta hai.

89
00:07:52,139 --> 00:07:54,102
H3 mein formula likhiye:

90
00:07:54,667 --> 00:08:01,536
=SUMIF('All Data'!$B:$B,$G3,'All Data'!$D:$D)

91
00:08:02,102 --> 00:08:09,014
Yahan pehla range Employee Name ka hai, doosra criteria cell G3 hai, aur last
range In Quantity ka hai.

92
00:08:09,579 --> 00:08:13,931
Excel Rahul Sharma ki sabhi entries ki In Quantity add karega.

93
00:08:14,496 --> 00:08:18,763
Ab isi tarah Out Quantity aur Amount ke formulas lagaiye.

94
00:08:21,627 --> 00:08:24,059
Formula ko neeche copy kar dijiye.

95
00:08:28,714 --> 00:08:36,436
Dekhiye, Rahul Sharma ka total In Quantity 220, Out Quantity 53 aur Amount
13100 hai.

96
00:08:37,001 --> 00:08:40,031
Priya Das aur Aman Khan ke totals bhi aa gaye.

97
00:08:40,596 --> 00:08:48,212
Toh difference samajh lijiye: SUMIF ek condition ke liye useful hai, aur SUMIFS
multiple conditions ke liye useful hai.

98
00:08:49,299 --> 00:08:52,499
Ab final report ko professional look dete hain.

99
00:08:53,064 --> 00:09:02,067
Headings ko bold karte hain, columns ki width adjust karte hain, Amount ko
number format dete hain, aur Grand Total row ko highlight karte hain.

100
00:09:02,632 --> 00:09:10,781
Ab ek useful baat samajhiye. Hamare formulas All Data ke poore
columns ko reference kar rahe hain. Isliye agar aap neeche koi naya

101
00:09:10,781 --> 00:09:18,867
transaction add karte hain, toh woh bhi calculation mein include
ho sakta hai, jab tak data sahi columns mein enter kiya gaya ho.

102
00:09:19,432 --> 00:09:26,656
Bade aur regularly update hone wale datasets ke liye
aap All Data ko Excel Table mein convert kar sakte

103
00:09:26,656 --> 00:09:33,320
hain. Data select karke Ctrl plus T press kijiye
aur confirm kijiye ki table mein headers hain.

104
00:09:33,885 --> 00:09:39,901
Excel Table se data manage karna aur naye records add karna aasaan ho sakta
hai.

105
00:09:40,466 --> 00:09:50,386
Lekin dhyan rahe, Summary sheet mein employee aur stock combinations bhi
update hone chahiye, agar koi naya employee ya naya stock item add hua hai.

106
00:09:51,473 --> 00:09:56,017
Final report save karne se pehle kuch important checks zaroor kariye.

107
00:09:56,582 --> 00:10:03,174
Pehla, sheet ka naam formula mein sahi hona chahiye. Hamare formulas mein
sheet ka naam All Data hai.

108
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:10,225
Doosra, Employee Name aur Stock Item ki spelling source data aur summary
dono mein match honi chahiye.

109
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:17,574
Teesra, In Quantity, Out Quantity aur Amount ke sum ranges sahi columns ko
refer karne chahiye.

110
00:10:18,139 --> 00:10:26,331
Chautha, agar koi naya employee ya naya stock item add hota hai, toh summary
mein us combination ko include karna na bhoolein.

111
00:10:26,897 --> 00:10:33,830
Aur paanchva, verify karein ki source data ki quantity aur amount columns mein
actual numeric values hain.

112
00:10:34,395 --> 00:10:38,875
In basic checks se aapki summary report zyada reliable rahegi.

113
00:10:39,962 --> 00:10:46,234
Toh dosto, aaj humne seekha ki Excel mein All Data sheet se doosri Summary
sheet kaise banate hain.

114
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:52,370
Humne SUMIFS se employee aur stock item
ke combination ka total nikala, SUMIF se

115
00:10:52,370 --> 00:10:58,149
employee-wise summary banayi, formulas ko
copy kiya aur Grand Total calculate kiya.

116
00:10:58,714 --> 00:11:07,162
Ab isi technique ko aap apne office reports, employee records, inventory, stock
registers aur sales data mein use kar sakte hain.

117
00:11:07,727 --> 00:11:18,479
Agar video helpful laga, toh ise like karein, Excel seekhne wale doston ke saath
share karein aur aise hi practical tutorials ke liye channel ko subscribe karein.

118
00:11:19,044 --> 00:11:21,434
Milte hain agle video mein. Thank you!
